        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "N1Mvo",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 单一状态机 sidebarCollapsed：宽屏 = 宽度归零，窄屏 = drawer；JS 零宽度计算（PRD §3.1）",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Dv79k",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 开关按钮常驻 #header 左侧（R2）；快捷键 Ctrl/Cmd+B（R4）",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qMol5",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 断点三档：≤768px drawer（含 768）/ 769–1024px 收窄至 200px / >1024px 全宽 240px（§3.6）",
